        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**SITE B WITH FULL PLANNING PERMISSION**\r\n\r\nAn appealing opportunity to build a contemporary detached family home with its own entrance from Avondale Park, off Killiney Road, Killiney. Off Street Parking. \r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 200 m² over two levels, Barrow’s proposed layout combines sociable living spaces with separate rooms for work and relaxation. A spacious kitchen and dining room forms the heart of the home, supported by a pantry, utility room and mud/cloak area.\r\n\r\nA separate family room connects with the rear garden, while an additional living room and ground-floor study provide valuable flexibility. Upstairs, four bedrooms include a principal bedroom with en-suite, alongside a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe proposed exterior pairs pale render with timber accents and dark-framed glazing. Private outdoor space and off-street parking, together with an anticipated A-rated energy specification, complete the plans for a comfortable, practical contemporary home.\r\n\r\nSite offered with planning permission under reference D25A/0792. The asking price is for the site; construction costs are additional.\r\n\r\nLink to Site A: hhttps://www.myhome.ie/residential/brochure/avalon-avondale-park-killiney-county-dublin/5028734\r\nLink to Main House:  https://www.myhome.ie/residential/brochure/coonawarra-38-killiney-road-dalkey-county-dublin/5028749"
